      "fieldData": {
        "avatar": {
          "fileId": "6aba20632eb7673deeca212a",
          "url": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a0b29c6d081332e921900d8/6aba20632eb7673deeca212a_6aba2059525e130282e72224_nancy-carleton-avatar.jpeg",
          "alt": "Nancy Carleton"
        },
        "bio-short": "Founder of That Layover Life. 87 countries, 7 continents marathoned. Copenhagen-based American expat. Travels with a Samoyed named Magnus 🐻‍❄️.",
        "bio-long": "<p>Founder of That Layover Life. American expat in Copenhagen since the spreadsheet hit 30 rows and never stopped.</p><p>87 countries on the board. 7 continents marathoned. 464 cities. 212 states. 97 large airports. On a Google Sheet that Jay calls the Trip Ledger.</p><p>Husband Jay, who carries the water. Samoyed Magnus 🐻‍❄️, who supervises. Tokyo Marathon and a first Ironman in Tallinn next year. Romania at Halloween. The Nordic Alpine Club next decade.</p><p>The platform is the people.</p>",
        "country-count": 87,
        "home-base": "Copenhagen, Denmark",
